# Patch series for the "wasm" target, range pg9-6 (PostgreSQL 9.x): one *.patch path per line, relative to this directory.
# Made by scripts/port-patches.js from the baseline series (10.23); entries in pg9-6/ are the patches that needed a port, the others are shared with the baseline.
